[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4990531190","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121441#issuecomment-4990531190","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121441","id":4990531190,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKXV2dg","user":{"login":"NoNormalDev","id":190293561,"node_id":"U_kgDOC1emOQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190293561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev","html_url":"https://github.com/NoNormalDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-16T09:55:42Z","updated_at":"2026-07-16T14:18:45Z","body":"The issue is probably that threads are used for the HTTPRequest: (which is a good thing, as non threaded HTTPRequests can be very slow due to a default limit)\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/49f68a134ec7997dda2eb5b92a1f43eb37273498/editor/export/export_template_manager.cpp#L1698-L1699\n\nWhile I cannot reproduce it on\n\n> Godot v4.7.1.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon(TM) Graphics (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 31.0.12027.9001) - AMD Ryzen 5 4600G with Radeon Graphics (12 threads) - 14.79 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono) \n\nthe deadlock is definitely real, but needs some conditions for it to occur. (will test on my main dev machine later today)\n\nMy guess is that this is going to be fixed by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121228 (which supersedes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117749, which also fixes the issue)\n\nAnd to be clear, by the \"Cancel\" button you meant the button marked in red?\n\n<img width=\"670\" height=\"743\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/53449ded-fb06-4dbc-845f-7151331ae193\" />","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4990531190/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4993186372","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121441#issuecomment-4993186372","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121441","id":4993186372,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKZ36RA","user":{"login":"SergioSauloDev","id":276403404,"node_id":"U_kgDOEHmUzA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276403404?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioSauloDev","html_url":"https://github.com/SergioSauloDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioSauloDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioSauloDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioSauloDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioSauloDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioSauloDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioSauloDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioSauloDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioSauloDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_u