hor_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5023923780/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5025494409","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121441#issuecomment-5025494409","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121441","id":5025494409,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABK4r1iQ","user":{"login":"SergioSauloDev","id":276403404,"node_id":"U_kgDOEHmUzA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276403404?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioSauloDev","html_url":"https://github.com/SergioSauloDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioSauloDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioSauloDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioSauloDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioSauloDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioSauloDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioSauloDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioSauloDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioSauloDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioSauloDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-20T18:01:21Z","updated_at":"2026-07-20T18:01:21Z","body":"> Aquí tienes una versión de editor de [#121228](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121228), que creo que puede resolver el problema:\n> \n> https://github.com/NoNormalDev/godot/actions/runs/29680077981/artifacts/8440782791\n> \n> ¿Podrías probarlo? (Comprueba si soluciona el problema)\n> \n> > Ten en cuenta que este artefacto no proviene de la PR mencionada, ya que tuve que modificar la versión a 4.7.stable, porque no se pueden descargar plantillas para versiones de desarrollador (pero sigue siendo una build desde el master, así que las últimas funciones/bugs de la 4.8 están en el editor).\n> \n> > Probablemente aparecerá en Defender que la app no es reconocida, pero el binario fue compilado por Github Actions, incluso puedes revisar el código fuente que modifiqué ([NoNormalDev@8f60f04](https://github.com/NoNormalDev/godot/commit/8f60f04b29d7bdd8acbe2b6426e84dec463c8899)), así que está seguro.\n\nHello. I tried to download the artifact, but I couldn't. The download starts normally and almost finishes, but it gets cancelled right at the end. I tested this on both Windows and Android. In Chrome, the download simply cancels. In Microsoft Edge, it cancels with a \"Permission denied\" error. I'm not sure if it's an issue with the artifact or something on my end, so I haven't been able to test it.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5025494409/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5025597182","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121441#issuecomment-5025597182","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121441","id":5025597182,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABK4yG_g","user":{"login":"NoNormalDev","id":190293561,"node_id":"U_kgDOC1emOQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190293561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev","html_url":"https://github.com/NoNormalDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"ht